@startuml aws_infrastructure
title SavePoint AWS infrastruktura (Terraform)

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor #EAF2F8
  BorderColor #2471A3
}
skinparam package {
  BackgroundColor #FBFCFC
  BorderColor #5D6D7E
}
skinparam node {
  BackgroundColor #F4F6F6
  BorderColor #566573
}
skinparam database {
  BackgroundColor #FDEBD0
  BorderColor #B9770E
}
skinparam cloud {
  BackgroundColor #FEF9E7
  BorderColor #B7950B
}

actor "Felhasznalo" as User

cloud "AWS fiok  --  Terraform altal kezelt infrastruktura" as AWS {

  component "ALB\n(Application Load Balancer)" as ALB

  package "VPC (10.0.0.0/16)" as VPC {
    package "EKS klaszter" as EKS {
      component "Worker node-ok\n(savepoint namespace pod-jai)" as Nodes
    }
    database "SQL Server\n(StatefulSet, EBS PVC)" as SQL
    Nodes --> SQL
  }

  component "ECR\n(4 kep repo)" as ECR
  component "Lambda\nreview-sentiment" as L1
  component "Lambda\ntop-games-snapshot" as L2
  component "EventBridge\n(cron)" as EB
  queue "SQS" as SQS
  database "DynamoDB" as Dyn
  database "S3\n(top-games snapshot)" as S3
}

User --> ALB : HTTP
ALB --> Nodes : path-alapu routing
Nodes ..> ECR : kep pull
Nodes --> SQS : review esemenyek
SQS --> L1
L1 --> Dyn
EB --> L2
L2 --> ALB : GET /api/game/popular
L2 --> S3

note bottom of AWS
  A teljes infrastruktura (VPC, EKS, ECR, ALB,
  Lambda, SQS, DynamoDB, S3, EventBridge)
  Terraform modulokkal van leirva es letrehozva.
end note

@enduml
